  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5ca3dc37bc93c41448ec7711e01fface, type: 3}
  m_Name: Doc_ChefDiary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CrimsonDraft.Navigation::CrimsonDraft.Navigation.Interactables.DocumentData
  title: Chef's Diary
  pages:
  - "I can\u2019t keep writing this like it\u2019s just another mission. The crew
    are no longer human. Those who consumed it have already crossed a point of no
    return; they keep moving, they react, they even seem to recognize voices, but
    there\u2019s nothing behind it. It wasn\u2019t immediate, and that makes it worse.
    There are moments when they seem to come back, but it\u2019s only a reflex, something
    imitating what they used to be.\r\n\r\nI did what I could to contain them. I
    sealed the rooms on Deck B, one by one, while I could still keep them under control,
    before they completely lost it. The doors I locked are marked with yellow signs."
  - "Everything is breaking down. It\u2019s not just the body, it\u2019s behavior,
    the way they organize, like something else is taking over. There\u2019s no protocol
    for this. There\u2019s no containment possible under these conditions. I have
    to go down to the lab. If there\u2019s still a way to stop this, it has to be
    there, or at least\u2026"
